    <h2 class="phpdocumentor-content__title">Post Office</h2>

    <p class="phpdocumentor-summary"></p>

    <p><strong>A self-service web frontend for mail servers running <a href="https://www.postfix.org/">Postfix</a> and
    <a href="https://www.dovecot.org/">Dovecot</a></strong></p>

    <p>The Post Office manages the domains, mailboxes, aliases and mailing lists of your mail server, which Postfix and
    Dovecot read from a shared <a href="https://mariadb.org/">MariaDB</a> or <a href="https://www.mysql.com/">MySQL</a>
    database. Every change takes effect immediately, without reloading or restarting anything.</p>

    <p>Users manage their own email accounts, and administrators can hand over the management of individual domains and
    mailing lists to other users. So you don't have to do everything yourself, and nobody needs shell access to the
    server.</p>

    <h3>Features</h3>

    <p><strong>Self-service for users:</strong> everyone logs in with their email address and password to change their
    name and password, check their storage quota, and see and leave the mailing lists they belong to.<br>
    <strong>Delegated management:</strong> administrators appoint <em>domain managers</em>, who manage all accounts and
    mailing lists of their domains, and domain managers appoint <em>list managers</em>, who look after the members and
    settings of individual mailing lists.<br>
    <strong>All common account types:</strong> mailboxes with storage quota, send-only addresses, aliases, mailing
    lists (open or members-only) and catch-all addresses are supported.<br>
    <strong>Mail server administration:</strong> TLS policies for outgoing emails and a blacklist of senders, managed
    right in the browser. Additionally, administrators can perform DNS health checks for mail domains.<br>
    <strong>Bulk emails and notifications:</strong> managers write emails to selected or all addresses of their domains
    and mailing lists.<br>
    <strong>Secure by default:</strong> strong passwords that are checked against known data breaches, rate-limited
    logins, and permissions that are checked on every action.<br>
    <strong>Available in English and German:</strong> chosen automatically according to the user's browser setting.</p>

    <p>This application follows the highest coding standards of <a href="https://psalm.dev/">Psalm</a>,
    <a href="https://phpstan.org/">PHPStan</a>, <a href="https://phpmd.org/">PHP Mess Detector</a>,
    <a href="https://github.com/PHPCSStandards/PHP_CodeSniffer/">PHP_CodeSniffer</a>, and complies to
    <a href="https://www.php-fig.org/psr/psr-12/">PSR-12</a> code style guidelines to make sure it is reliable,
    maintainable and easily reusable.</p>

